{"id":"2d001b083a9ba221","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-badness.md","title":"Fiber-Bound Badness Number","display":"df-badness — Fiber-Bound Badness Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-badness","aliases":["58-df-badness"],"display":"df-badness — Fiber-Bound Badness Number","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-badness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-badness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-badness — Fiber-Bound Badness Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-badness-—-Badness-Number\">df-badness — Badness Number</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,f\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (基数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (函数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{bad}_{\\mathrm{fib}}:V^2\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathrm{bad}_{\\mathrm{fib}}:V^2\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (本文件定义的最小纤维界函数)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}badness} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{bad}_{\\mathrm{fib}}(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\min\\Bigl\\{\\mu\\in V:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(|f^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}]|&lt;\\mu)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}badness} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{bad}_{\\mathrm{fib}}(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\min\\Bigl\\{\\mu\\in V:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(|f^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}]|&lt;\\mu)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{bad}_{\\mathrm{fib}}(\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{bad}_{\\mathrm{fib}}(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 到非零基数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 的某个函数所能达到的最小严格纤维基数界。</li>\n<li>下标 <code>fib</code> 将此基数值与知识库中表示“所有颜色类均非平稳”的二元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{bad}(\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{bad}(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span> 区分开，避免同名异型。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-badness-—-Badness-Number","text":"df-badness — Badness Number","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V$ (基数谓词, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (函数谓词, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mu,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{bad}_{\\mathrm{fib}}:V^2\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}badness} \\vdash \\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda\\neq0\\Bigr)\\to\\mathrm{bad}_{\\mathrm{fib}}(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\min\\Bigl\\{\\mu\\in V:\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\exists f\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Function}(f,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;(|f^{-1}[\\{\\alpha\\}]|<\\mu)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{bad}_{\\mathrm{fib}}(\\kappa,\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},